# Code Owners
#
# Code owners are automatically asked to review pull requests that change the
# files they own. When the default branch requires reviews from Code Owners,
# their approval is needed before merge. This keeps a person accountable for
# every change, including changes made with AI tools and AI agents.
#
# When several rules match a file, the last matching rule wins. Replace
# @dileepadev with the GitHub usernames or teams that maintain your project.

# Default owner of everything in the repository
*                     @dileepadev

# Governance, policy, and security documents
/AI_POLICY.md         @dileepadev
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md   @dileepadev
/SECURITY.md          @dileepadev
/LICENSE              @dileepadev

# AI agent instruction files: changes here change how AI agents behave
